    "text": "Men \u00f0a leofestan, we gehyrdon oft s\u00e6cgan be \u00feam \u00e6\u00feelan tocyme ures drihtnes, hu he him on \u00f0as\n\u00de\u00e6t heahf\u00e6deras s\u00e6don and cyddon, \u00fe\u00e6t witegan witegedan and heredan, \u00fe\u00e6t sealmscopas sungan and\nEall \u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6s gel\u00e6sted, sy\u00f0\u00f0an heofenas tohlidan, and seo hea miht on \u00f0isne wang gestah, and se halga\n\u00d0a ealra f\u00e6mnena cwen cende \u00feone so\u00f0an scyppend and ealles folces frefriend and ealles middaneardes\n\u00d0urh \u00f0a byr\u00feran we w\u00e6ron geh\u00e6lede, and \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6t gebyr\u00f0or we wurdon alysede, and \u00feurh \u00fea\nAnd sy\u00f0\u00f0an he drihten Crist her on weorulde wunade mid mannum and hym fela wundra cydde and\nAc \u00fea se \u00e6lmihtiga god afyrsode hym \u00feone unrihtan wrigels of heora heortum and heo onlihte mid\n\u00c6r\u00feam we w\u00e6ron steopcild gewordene, for\u00f0an we w\u00e6ron astypede \u00fe\u00e6s heofenlican rices, and we\nSyndan we nu eft \u00feider amearcode \u00feurh \u00feone so\u00f0an scyppend and \u00feurh \u00feone lifigendan god and \u00feurh\nNe gelette us \u00fe\u00e6s si\u00f0es se fecna feond ne us ne forwyrne \u00fe\u00e6s wilweges ne us \u00fea gata ne betyne, \u00fee us\nAnd utan we \u00fea drihtenlican w\u00e6ra simble gehealdan and \u00fea siblican lufan godes and manna.\nNe syn we to gifre ne to frece ne to firenlustgeorne ne to \u00e6festige ne to inwitfulle ne to t\u00e6lende ne to\nNe werignessa we ne fylian ne heafodlice leahtras ne lufian ne scyncr\u00e6ftas onhyrgen ne galdorsangas\nAc wi\u00f0 \u00feas uncysta ealle we us scylan warnian, \u00f0a \u00fee gode la\u00f0oste syndon, \u00fe\u00e6t we \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feone\nAnd ge\u00feencan we \u00feone dom, \u00fee we to gela\u00f0ode syndan, and \u00feone deman, \u00fee to \u00f0am dome cym\u00f0.\nHe dem\u00f0 rihtne dom and emne dom.\nNe bi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6r hada andfengnes mid gode ne cyninga seara \u00ferymmum gefr\u00e6tewad butan \u00feam anum, \u00fee\nNe beo\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6r for\u00f0 borene sigele ne beagas ne heora heafodgold to \u00f0am sigedeman.\nAc on \u00feam gemote stande\u00f0 anra manna gehwylces sawl and bi\u00f0 for\u00f0 l\u00e6dende eall \u00fea weorc, \u00fee heo \u00e6r\nGif \u00feonne beo\u00f0 maran \u00fea misd\u00e6da and \u00fe\u00e6s godes to lyt, \u00feonne wynsuma\u00f0 se wi\u00f0erwearda feond and\nAnd he bealdlice clypa\u00f0 to \u00feam hean deman and \u00feus cwe\u00f0, dem, la dema, dem rihtne dom and emne\nGearelice witan \u00feas heregas \u00fereo, \u00fee \u00f0e mid syndon, an is se heofonlica \u00f0reat, se \u00f0e mid f\u00e6re\u00f0 and \u00fee\nDem, la drihten, dem rihte domas and emne domas.\nForl\u00e6t me mines wyr\u00f0e wesan, \u00fe\u00e6s \u00f0e ic me sylf begiten h\u00e6bbe; \u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6ron mine, \u00fea \u00f0e to \u00f0e noldan.\nRihtlic is, \u00fe\u00e6t ic \u00f0a mid witum witnige, \u00fea \u00fee \u00feine hersumnesse forhogedon; heo scirpton heo mid\n\u00d0onne heo gehyrdon \u00feine bec r\u00e6dan and \u00fein godspel s\u00e6cgan and heora lif rihtan and hym ecne weg\nAc \u00feonne ic mine hearpan genam and mine strengas styrian ongan, heo \u00fe\u00e6t lustlice gehyrdon and fram\n\u00de\u00e6t ic wolde, \u00fe\u00e6t hy \u00fee afremdedon, and hw\u00e6t woldan hy on minum hordcleofan and \u00feine circean\nDem, la drihten, ealra gesceafta reccend and styrend, rihtne dom.\nHw\u00e6t \u00feu \u00fee sylfne geeadmeddest for heora ealra lufan and for ure l\u00e6\u00f0\u00f0e \u00fein feorh for heora on dea\u00f0\n\u00dea hy to me cyrdon, n\u00e6fre ic him are gefremede ne \u00e6nige helpe ne geu\u00f0e.\nAc forl\u00e6t me hy on wita l\u00e6dan and on susle cwylmian and \u00fea mishernessa gewrecan, \u00fee hy wi\u00f0 \u00fee\nHw\u00e6t, we nu gehyrdon, hu bealdlice se deofol sprec\u00f0 to \u00feam h\u00e6lende and \u00fea synd\u00e6da st\u00e6le\u00f0 on \u00fea\nHine \u00feonne ofer eaxle besih\u00f0 se so\u00f0f\u00e6sta dema and se rihtwisesta to \u00feam forwyrhtum and to \u00feam\n\u00d0onne bi\u00f0 drihtnes word re\u00f0e gehyred, \u00feam synfullum stefna strangas.\nHabbe we \u00feonne, men \u00fea leofestan, mycle ned\u00feearfe, \u00fe\u00e6t we ne syn mid \u00feam scyldigum, ac mid \u00feam\nWe scylon mildheortnesse geearnian, \u00fe\u00e6t we eft mildne deman gemetan and arf\u00e6stne.\nW\u00e6ron we \u00feonne oft gemyngode to ures drihtnes hersumnesse, \u00fe\u00e6t we sceoldan his willan wyrcan\nAnd gif we \u00feas weorc onginna\u00f0, gel\u00e6sta\u00f0 and gehealda\u00f0, \u00feonne beo we godes dyrlingas on heofonum.\nNis urum h\u00e6lende nan \u00feing behyddes ne bedigledes, \u00fe\u00e6s \u00f0e men wyrca\u00f0 on \u00feysse worulde, for\u00f0am \u00fee\nSwa Sanctus Jacobus Cristes discipul s\u00e6de, hu se h\u00e6lend spr\u00e6c to sumum weligum men, \u00fee he hine\nAnd se h\u00e6lend hine \u00feara leana eft gemyngode, \u00fea he cw\u00e6\u00f0, ne gemundest \u00feu na Salamones cwide, \u00fee\nEfne hit bi\u00f0 gelic, \u00fe\u00e6t man mid w\u00e6tere \u00feone weallendan welm ofgeote, \u00fe\u00e6t he leng me mot rixian,\n\u00d0onne noldest \u00feu, weliga, mine bebodu healdan, ac, sceolde se min \u00feearfa asw\u00e6man \u00e6t \u00feinre handa,\n\u00deonne he clypode earmre st\u00e6mne, \u00feu wi\u00f0soce, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu hine geherdest, ac ic his geomerunge gehyrde\nMine \u00feearfan \u00fee mildheortnesse b\u00e6don, and \u00feu hy forhogedest and geunrettest and \u00feinne andwlitan\nSe h\u00e6lend cw\u00e6\u00f0 to \u00feam wlancan, for hwi w\u00e6re \u00feu swa f\u00e6sthafol minra goda, \u00fee ic \u00fee sealde?\nTo hwon receleasadest \u00feu \u00f0\u00e6re gife, \u00fee ic \u00f0e geaf?\nIc \u00fee nu afyrre fram minre selene, \u00fee ic \u00fee forgeaf; \u00feonne bist \u00feu w\u00e6dla on woruldlife.\nFor hwon noldest \u00feu ge\u00feencan, \u00fe\u00e6t ic wille forgeldan \u00e6ghwylcum men ane gode d\u00e6de, \u00fee for minum\nMid hundteontigum ic hit him forgylde, swa hit is on minum godspelle gecweden and ges\u00e6d, swa oft\n\u00deu man, to hwan eart \u00feu me swa unge\u00feancfull minra gifena?\nHw\u00e6t, ic \u00f0e gesceop and geliff\u00e6ste, and \u00e6ghw\u00e6t, \u00fe\u00e6s \u00f0e \u00feu hafast, ic \u00f0e sealde.\nMin is eall, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu h\u00e6fst, and \u00fein nis nan wiht.\nIc hit eall afyrre fram \u00fee.\n\u00deu leofa butan me, gif \u00feu m\u00e6ge.\n\u00dee ic hit sealde, to \u00fean \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu hit sceoldest \u00feearfum d\u00e6lan.\nIc swerige \u00feurh me sylfne, \u00fe\u00e6t ic eom se ilca god, \u00fee \u00feone weligan and \u00feone heanan geworhte mid\n\u00de\u00e6t ic wolde, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu mine \u00feearfan feddest, \u00feonne hy w\u00e6ron \u00fee biddende minra goda, and \u00feu him\nFor hwon noldest \u00feu hit ge\u00feencan, gif \u00feu him mildheortnesse on gecyddest, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu ne sceoldest \u00fe\u00e6s\nTo hwon anum agnodest \u00feu \u00fee, \u00fe\u00e6t ic inc bam sealde?\nTo hwon feddest \u00feu \u00fee \u00e6nne of \u00fe\u00e6m, \u00fee ic inc bam gesceop to welan and to wiste and to feorhnere?\nTo hwon heolde \u00feu hit \u00fee anum and \u00feinum bearnum, \u00fe\u00e6t mihte manegum genihtsumian on?\nUny\u00f0e \u00fee w\u00e6s, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu eall ne mihtest gef\u00e6stnian ne mid inseglum beclysan.\nWenst \u00feu, \u00fe\u00e6t hit \u00fein sy, \u00fe\u00e6t seo eor\u00f0e \u00fee for\u00f0 bringe\u00f0?\nHeo growe\u00f0 and blowe\u00f0 and s\u00e6d l\u00e6de\u00f0 and andlifan bringe\u00f0.\nIc nu afyrre minne fultum fram \u00fee; hafa \u00feu \u00e6t \u00feinum gewinne, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu m\u00e6ge, and \u00e6t \u00feinum geswince.\nIc \u00f0e \u00e6tbrede mine hrenas, \u00fe\u00e6t heo \u00feinre eor\u00f0an ne hrina\u00f0; ic afyrre fram \u00fee mine mildheortnesse, and\nGif \u00feu wene, \u00fe\u00e6t hit \u00fein bocland sy, and on agene \u00e6ht geseald, hit \u00feonne w\u00e6ron mine w\u00e6ter, \u00fea \u00fee on\nGif \u00feu mihte h\u00e6bbe, d\u00e6l renas ofer \u00feine eor\u00f0an.\nGif \u00feu strang sy, syle w\u00e6stmas \u00feinre eor\u00f0an.\nIc ahyrde mine sunnan, and heo gebyrhte\u00f0: \u00feonne forb\u00e6rne\u00f0 heo ealle \u00feine \u00e6ceras, and \u00feonne bist \u00feu\nMine \u00feearfan lifia\u00f0 be me; gif \u00feu m\u00e6ge, wuna butan me.\nMine \u00feearfan me ealne weg habba\u00f0, and ic hy n\u00e6fre ne forl\u00e6te.\nMine \u00feearfan hy me lufia\u00f0, and hy hycga\u00f0 ymb heora drihten and hine gelome nemna\u00f0 and lufia\u00f0 and\n\u00d0onne, \u00feu weliga, ne \u00feu \u00feinne drihten ne lufadest, ne \u00feu are \u00e6t him h\u00e6fst, ne \u00feu, earming, ne most\nHw\u00e6t, wendest \u00feu, wlanca, gif \u00feu me sealdest owiht \u00feines, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fee \u00feonne w\u00e6re \u00fein woruldgestreon\nHw\u00e6t, \u00feu to lyt hogedest ymb \u00feone ende \u00feines lifes; to dol \u00feu w\u00e6re and to gedyrstig, \u00fea \u00feu wendest,\nIc wat hw\u00e6\u00f0ere, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fein lif geenda\u00f0, \u00feonne \u00feu his ne wenest.\n\u00d0u weliga, to hwon treowodest \u00feu on \u00feinne welan and on oferflownessa \u00feinra goda and na on me, \u00fee\nHe \u00f0a drihten Crist cw\u00e6\u00f0 to \u00feam weligan men, eala, \u00feu dysiga and \u00feu gedweleda, to hwan\n\u00dein sawl bi\u00f0 afyrred fram \u00fee in \u00feisse ilcan nihte and be minre h\u00e6se of \u00feinum lichaman gel\u00e6ded.\nAc hwa feh\u00f0 \u00feonne to \u00fean, \u00f0e \u00feu lange samnodest, o\u00f0\u00f0e hwam gearwadest \u00feu \u00fein bold and \u00feine\nSceoldan \u00fea word beon ealle cu\u00f0lice gel\u00e6ste and gefyllede, \u00fee se h\u00e6lend sylf cw\u00e6\u00f0.\nHine \u00fea \u00feone weligan man \u00fe\u00e6re ilcan nihte dea\u00f0 on becom and on his bearn ealle; fengan \u00fea to his\nHw\u00e6t, we nu magon, men \u00fea leofestan, be \u00feysum ongitan and oncnawan, \u00fe\u00e6t se \u00e6lmihtiga god nele,\nNe \u00feurfan we na \u00fe\u00e6s wenan, \u00fe\u00e6t he us nolde \u00fe\u00e6ra leana eft gemanian, \u00fee he us to gode forgeaf her on\nEfne swa he us m\u00e6rlicor gife\u00f0, swa we him m\u00e6rlicor \u00feancian scylon; swa \u00ferymlicre ar, swa mare\n\u00d0am \u00fee drihten micel syle\u00f0, mycles he hine eft mana\u00f0; \u00feam \u00fee he micel to forl\u00e6te\u00f0, mycel he eft to\n\u00c6ghwylc heah ar her on worulde bi\u00f0 mid frecnessum geseald, efne swa \u00fea woruldge\u00feinc\u00f0a beo\u00f0\nSwa we magon be \u00feam \u00fea bysne oncnawan and ongitan, \u00fe\u00e6t treow \u00feonne, \u00fee wexe\u00f0 on \u00feam\nSwa bi\u00f0 eac gelice be \u00feam heaclifum and torrum, \u00feonne hi hlifia\u00f0 feor up ofer \u00fea o\u00f0re eor\u00f0an, hy\nSwylce eac be \u00f0am hean muntum and dunum, \u00fea \u00f0e heah standa\u00f0 ofer ealne middaneard, \u00fea hw\u00e6\u00f0ere\nSwa \u00f0a hean mihta her on worulde hreosa\u00f0 and fealla\u00f0 and to lore weor\u00f0a\u00f0, \u00feisse worulde welan\n\u00d0eah we \u00feissa worulde wlenca tilian swi\u00f0e and in wuldre scinan swi\u00f0e; \u00feeah we us gescirpen mid \u00fey\n\u00d0eah \u00fee \u00f0a mihtegestan and \u00fea ricestan hatan him reste gewyrcan of marmanstane and mid\n\u00deonne bi\u00f0 se glencg agoten and se \u00ferym tobroden and \u00fea gimmas toglidene and \u00fe\u00e6t gold tosceacen\nFor\u00f0am nis naht \u00feyses middaneardes wlite, ac he is tweogendlic \u00feysse worulde wela, he is hwilendlic\nHw\u00e6r syndon nu \u00fea rican caseras and \u00fea cyningas, \u00fee io w\u00e6ron, o\u00f0\u00f0e ealdormen, \u00fee beboda setton?\nHw\u00e6r is demera domstow?\nHw\u00e6r is heora ofermedla, butan mid moldan be\u00f0eaht and in witum gewrecen?\nWa is worulde scriftum, butan heo mid rihte domas reccan; ne bi\u00f0 \u00feam leornerum nahte \u00fee sel, \u00feonne\nHw\u00e6r com middaneardes gestreon?\nHw\u00e6r com worulde wela?\nHw\u00e6r com foldan f\u00e6gernes?\nHw\u00e6r coman \u00fea, \u00fee geornlicost \u00e6hta tiledan and o\u00f0rum eft yrfe l\u00e6fdon?\nSwylc is seo oferlufu eor\u00fean gestreona: efne bi\u00f0 gelice rena scurum, \u00feonne hy of heofenum swi\u00f0ost\n\u00deonne bi\u00f0 ful uncu\u00f0, hu se dema ymbe \u00fe\u00e6t don gewile, for\u00f0an nis us nan wiht betere ne selre, \u00feonne\nFor \u00feissum eor\u00f0licum wisum ic sylle \u00fea heofonlican, for \u00feissum l\u00e6nan life \u00fe\u00e6t unl\u00e6ne for \u00feissum\nGes\u00e6lige beo\u00f0 \u00fea, \u00f0e \u00feam fylia\u00f0; ne helpe\u00f0 \u00feam men \u00e6nig wiht, \u00feeah \u00fee he ealne \u00feysne middaneard\nUtan we us \u00feonne nu wendan to \u00feam beteran and cyrran to \u00feam selran, \u00feonne motan we geseon so\u00f0ne\n\u00de\u00e6r is fr\u00e6twednesse, \u00fe\u00e6s \u00e6\u00feelestan \u00e6\u00feelinges, and \u00fe\u00e6r is cyninges \u00ferym gesene and \u00fe\u00e6 is arwyr\u00f0n\n\u00d0\u00e6r is gesene \u00feegnes iogu\u00f0e, and \u00fe\u00e6r is ar and f\u00e6gernes werum and wifum and ge\u00feoftscipe engla and\n\u00de\u00e6r is sang and wynsang and godes lof and \u00fe\u00e6s hehstan cyninges herenes and seo beorhtnes \u00fe\u00e6ra\nWe w\u00e6ron \u00feider gehatene and gela\u00f0ede to \u00f0am halgan ham and to \u00f0am cynelican fri\u00f0stole, \u00fe\u00e6r",
